Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.35,0:02:05.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告 一辆黑色阿尔法罗密欧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正尾随一辆灰色阿斯顿马丁跑车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.34,0:02:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双方发生枪战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(意大利 锡耶纳)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该下车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《007系列之大破量子危机》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别流血致死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bleed to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 米丘 邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mitchell. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国佬一定不会很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Americans are gonna be none too pleased about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不是找到勒齐弗了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised them Le Chiffre, and they got Le Chiffre.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们找到他的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要他的灵魂 得找一个神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they'd wanted his soul, they should have made a deal with a priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:07:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有没有招什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has he said anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:00.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去查看周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to check the perimeter, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来很累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几时睡过觉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's the last time you slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤瑟夫 卡毕拉 维丝普的男友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vesper's boyfriend, Yusef Kabira, the one who was abducted in Morocco,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在摩洛哥被绑架 她想救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one she was trying to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的尸体被冲到伊比萨海滩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His body was washed up on a beach in lbiza.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶手要我们相信脸被鱼咬成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're meant to believe the fish did that to his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他口袋有皮夹和身份证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His wallet and ID were in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太刻意了 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's convenient. Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用他在女友家留下的一撮头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why I did a DNA check
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行DNA检验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a lock of his hair found in Vesper's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:31.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一撮头发?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lock of his hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到维丝普这么念旧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't have thought Vesper the sentimental type.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知人知面不知心 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we never really know anyone, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我得知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do need to know, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得知道我能信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know that I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:45.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不信任我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有冷血杀手...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it'd be a pretty cold bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不会为了心爱的人报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who didn't want revenge for the death of someone he loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必担心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会追杀他 他不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna go chasing him. He's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither was she.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.45,0:09:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's clear, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 米丘　来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Mitchell. Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说不说你为谁工作?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna tell us who you work for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直很想见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was always very interested to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维丝普经常提起你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd heard so much about you from Vesper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜 要是她没自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real shame is that if she hadn't killed herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也会替我们做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we would have had you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为了她什么都肯做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you would have done anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里不是英国 天晓得明天你会在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know you're not in Britain, and God knows where you'll be tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你会说出...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which should tell you that eventually
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你替谁做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will tell us about the people you work with,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愈不说 就会愈痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the longer it takes, the more painful we'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.67,0:09:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们对我们真的一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really don't know anything about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有趣 因为我们以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so amusing because we are on the other side,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们和中情局都在监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thinking, "The Ml6, the CIA, they're looking over our shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:09.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,监听我们的谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"They're listening to our conversations."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们却不知道我们的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the truth is you don't even know we exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在知道了 我们学得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we do now, Mr. White, and we're quick learners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? 那么你们应该要知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really? Well, then, the first thing you should know about us
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.03,0:10:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都有我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that we have people everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有线索吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克雷格 米丘替我做事八年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Craig Mitchell worked for me for eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每年都通过安全检查和测谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He passed a full security check and lie detector test every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连一点证据都没留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't leave so much as a scrap of paper to explain any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八年啊! 其中五年还是我的贴身保镖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight years! Five as my personal bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只找到这玩意 还有三件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found this and three other bloody Christmas presents
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我送他的圣诞礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bought him about the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他应该不抽烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you had to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是带他回来问话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't bring him in for questioning so that we might actually learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人说到处都有他们的人 你一定认为是夸大其词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When someone says we got people everywhere, you expect it to be hyperbole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人都会这么说 像是花店老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of people say that. Florists use that expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不代表他们派人埋伏在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't mean that they've got somebody working for them inside the bloody room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼组织?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this organization, Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们遍布四处我们却无所知?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can they be everywhere and we know nothing about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜怀特消失不见了 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume we found no trace of White. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在门口看到的探员死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agent guarding the door in the garage was dead
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在你在楼梯处经过他之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you passed him on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:32.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他? 老天爷!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I passed him on the stairs? Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是被米丘杀死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mitchell must have killed him when he went out to check the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能活着算是幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.45,0:16:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为怀特还活着吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think White's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克雷格 米丘 45岁 没有家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Craig Mitchell, 45 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经常捐款给慈善机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No living family. Gave generously to charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说你只知道这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me you know more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们查过他皮夹和家里的钞票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our moneymen went through every bill in Mitchell's wallet and house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有多少钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much did he have?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不到一百英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Less than 100 pounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧元和美金也差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and about the same in euros and dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.09,0:16:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Excuse me, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进行过完全的分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've done a complete forensic analysis
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:16:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每张钞票和其来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of every note and its traceable history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没心情听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米丘皮夹的这张钞票很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This particular note from Mitchell's wallet may be of interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫描中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拦截勒齐弗的非法交易时...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We introduced tagged bills into Le Chiffre's money-laundering operation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在钞票上面做了记号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by intercepting illegal payoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,透过他的银行帐户追踪来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We traced money through several of his bank accounts around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不成证据 钞票流通得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pretty thin. At the rate money changes hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好我也有做记号的钞票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you could probably find a tenner in my wallet with a tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 一张钞票可能是巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true, ma'am. A single bill could be a coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是一整叠呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what about a whole stack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:28.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些钞票的编号和米丘的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These bills, from the same series as Mitchell's,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚在海地的太子港被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were just scanned at a bank in Port-au-Prince, Haiti,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被存进史莱特先生的帐户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deposited in the account of a Mr. Slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说来听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史先生今早从英国返回太子港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a Mr. Edmund Slate returning to Port-au-Prince from Heathrow this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入境卡显示他住在迪萨利旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His entry documents have him staying at the Hotel Dessalines.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,325号房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in room 325.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:55.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(海地 太子港)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢　- 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(迪萨利旅馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,325号房有留言吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any messages for 325?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 只有稍早替您...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. The only message was about the briefcase
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄放的公事包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was delivered earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您要寄在柜台吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you want us to continue holding it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我要拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I'll take that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢　- 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:33.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.77,0:20:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.57,0:20:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我临时跟人开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got pulled into a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.91,0:20:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who with?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀特先生的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend of Mr. White's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:21:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你长得跟我想的不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look at all like I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? 你以为我长什么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? What were you expecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到地质学家长得这么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think geologists looked so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我让开! 闪边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还没谈好价钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't settle on a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出个价吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make me an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会儿边喝酒边谈 如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can work it out later, over drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多明尼克有找你麻烦吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic didn't give you any trouble, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人想要暗杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think someone wants to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好心没好报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该射杀她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.87,0:22:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没射中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打给邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接近港口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching the docks, Kings Quay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连线中　坦纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connecting. Tanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.14,0:22:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电话通了　问他史莱特的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got Bond. Ask him about Slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史莱特怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants to know about Slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.93,0:22:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是步死棋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell her Slate was a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史莱特是步死棋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slate was a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.06,0:22:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通话断线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connection terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 他杀死了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn him. He killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.83,0:23:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让她进去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.43,0:23:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇! 哇! 哇! 哇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敢碰我 我就折断你的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touch me and I'll break your wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.35,0:23:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有访客 别烦我 我在忙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡蜜儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camille.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到我还活着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alive, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.16,0:23:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道我们不该上床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew we shouldn't have slept together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开始喜欢上你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm starting to like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.79,0:23:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是真的想要杀死我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you did just try and have me killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想到再也见不到你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that made me very sad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.51,0:23:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thinking I would never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.43,0:23:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好你没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.22,0:23:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多明尼克 我想帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Dominic! I was trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想替你逮到内鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to uncover a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却派人暗杀我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, you sent someone to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别把我当成傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't talk to me like I'm stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.86,0:24:11.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样子很丑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unattractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.95,0:24:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 我给你看样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.45,0:24:22.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最不喜欢朋友...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing that makes me more uncomfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.71,0:24:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我背后说闲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than friends talking behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.21,0:24:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels like
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.71,0:24:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蚂蚁爬满我全身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ants under my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.63,0:24:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been that way forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得15岁那年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember when I was 15,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.84,0:24:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我偷偷暗恋我妈的钢琴学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a crush on one of my mother's piano students.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不巧 我听到她说我的坏话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow I overheard her saying very nasty things about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.98,0:24:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我气到不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.98,0:24:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是拿了一个熨斗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took an iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.11,0:24:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.41,0:24:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.49,0:24:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只跟他通过电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only spoke on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜 他是最好的地质学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's such a shame because he's one of my best geologists.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.67,0:25:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说你想买一些资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said you asked to buy information.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.67,0:25:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他打给我想卖我一些资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He called me and offered to sell me information.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.05,0:25:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我说谎干嘛回来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I come back here if I was lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.80,0:25:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你爱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.26,0:25:22.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.52,0:25:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止他出卖你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To stop him from betraying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.65,0:25:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有件事比你向我说谎更让我生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what burns more than all your bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.90,0:25:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直觉得你跟我上床是为了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that I always got the feeling that you were only sleeping with me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.44,0:25:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接近马卓诺将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get to General Medrano.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.70,0:25:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.12,0:25:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很了解被放逐的独裁者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how these deposed dictators are,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.29,0:25:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是没有安全感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}jealous of their safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.29,0:25:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.63,0:25:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他介绍给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.46,0:25:56.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你把这个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see the girl that just walked in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.13,0:25:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给刚才那个女生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you give her that? Tell her to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.18,0:26:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.93,0:26:07.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要她打给他
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(寰宇出口商)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.75,0:26:14.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(全球定位系统信号追踪)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(连接安全管道 绿色星球)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.35,0:26:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(目标确认)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.53,0:26:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是寰宇出口商...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've reached Universal Exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.70,0:26:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼下办公室关着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our offices are currently closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.83,0:26:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次聪明点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.75,0:26:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以替我办到这件事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can do all this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.13,0:26:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我们把这国家搞成怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look at what we did to this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.17,0:26:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海地人选一个神父当总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Haitians elect a priest
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.72,0:26:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把最低工资从38分调到1元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who decides to raise the minimum wage from 38 cents to $1 a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.51,0:26:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.60,0:26:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不多 但是已经让...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a lot, but it's enough to upset the corporations
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.10,0:26:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制造T恤和跑鞋的工厂很不爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who were here making T-shirts and running shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.64,0:26:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是他们找我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they called us,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们则替他们改变现状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we facilitated a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.82,0:26:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不同的是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The difference is,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.98,0:26:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的国家并不是加勒比海的一个小岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my country's not some flyspeck in the middle of the Caribbean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.20,0:27:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们已经开始造成政治不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we've already begun destabilizing the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.70,0:27:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会提供私人保全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll supply the private security.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.20,0:27:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会贿赂重要的官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll pay off the right officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也说服26个国家...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have 26 countries ready to officially recognize
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正式和全新的玻利维亚政府建交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your new Bolivian government.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.05,0:27:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要夺回你的国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want your country back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.63,0:27:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的组织可以在一周内办到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My organization can give it to you within the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.01,0:27:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.06,0:27:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要什么做为回报?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in return you want what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.56,0:27:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一片沙漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This part.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.23,0:27:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那地方一文不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This land is worthless. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.74,0:27:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你算是捡到便宜啰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're getting a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.87,0:27:45.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在那里挖不到石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find oil there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.91,0:27:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都试过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone has tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.04,0:27:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧 也许没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.33,0:27:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过找到什么都是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we own whatever we find.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.72,0:28:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识埃内斯托 蒙特斯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know Ernesto Montes?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.68,0:28:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他当年权力很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very powerful man in his day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.18,0:28:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有一个很美的俄国妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a beautiful Russian wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.56,0:28:11.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一名舞者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.77,0:28:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他女儿替我做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, his daughter works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.77,0:28:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者是...曾经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.73,0:28:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's lovely,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.78,0:28:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过她不像她母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't see the resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.95,0:28:23.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她当成这笔交易的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you consider her
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.66,0:28:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,额外好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as something to sweeten the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.45,0:28:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完事后一定要把她解决掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just promise me to drop her over the side when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.25,0:28:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡蜜儿 马卓诺将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camille, General Medrano.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.34,0:28:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识你的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.78,0:28:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾 见过他们死前最后一面
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.81,0:28:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿望实现有时候不是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful what you wish for, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.65,0:29:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩得开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.24,0:30:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.36,0:30:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气! 白痴! 带我回去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome! You idiot! Take me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许晚一点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, maybe I'll do that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.58,0:30:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是格林的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not one of Greene's.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.91,0:30:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多明尼克 格林?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic Greene?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.04,0:30:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.15,0:31:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来掌舵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.24,0:31:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来导航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Navigate!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.58,0:31:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向左\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛? 抓紧了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:49.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.90,0:33:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 她晕船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. She's seasick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.10,0:33:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.77,0:33:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connect Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接听　请说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connecting 007. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.02,0:33:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查缉对象: 多明尼克 格林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name check, Dominic Greene.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.28,0:33:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,G-R-E-E-N-E 格林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}G-R-E-E-N-E.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.74,0:33:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有其他的资料吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might need a little more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.82,0:33:59.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人叫这个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a lot of Dominic Greenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.91,0:34:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有社会安全码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a social security
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.16,0:34:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或护照号码? 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or passport number? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.99,0:34:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜寻法国情报局资料库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning DGSE databases.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.87,0:34:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查到什么? 搜寻KGB资料库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything? Scanning KGB databases.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.92,0:34:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有查到什么? 叫她听电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have anything? Will you put her on, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.17,0:34:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在听 史莱特怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am on, Bond. What happened to Slate?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.88,0:34:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是过去式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not dwelling on the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.13,0:34:15.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you should, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.30,0:34:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.38,0:34:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最接近的结果 多明尼克 格林 绿色星球执行长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Largest hit, Dominic Greene, CEO of Greene Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.47,0:34:21.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一家水电能源公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a utility company,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.43,0:34:23.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他也从事慈善事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Greene's been doing a lot of philanthropic work,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.97,0:34:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,购买土地做为生态保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}buying up large tracts of land for ecological preserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.81,0:34:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照片传过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be getting his picture now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.65,0:34:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.07,0:34:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的电脑系统装了防火墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid there's a firewall around his other corporate holdings,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.32,0:34:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查不到其它资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we have no other information.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.53,0:34:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我接美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.15,0:34:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接线中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.65,0:34:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.78,0:34:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多明尼克 格林 绿色星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interest in Dominic Greene, Greene Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.58,0:34:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上替您转接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transferring you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.25,0:34:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷戈里 毕恩在线上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold for Gregory Beam, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.42,0:34:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.50,0:34:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是格雷戈里 毕恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, this is Gregory Beam, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.50,0:34:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 毕恩先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mr. Beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.25,0:34:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉让您久等 我们对格林先生没兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry to keep you waiting. We have no interest in Mr. Greene.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.92,0:34:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.43,0:35:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连线中止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connection terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.55,0:35:02.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他对格林兴趣很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a person of extreme interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.43,0:35:04.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他说他没兴趣... 我一提到格林...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he just said that he wasn't... Tanner, I asked about the man
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.89,0:35:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就被转接到中情局南美洲的主管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she transferred me to the section chief of South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.64,0:35:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这代表他们一定在调查他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would she know to do that if they weren't tracking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.19,0:35:17.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你正接近一座机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond, we have your location as approaching an airfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.69,0:35:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 格林准备起飞吗? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is Greene on the move? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.65,0:35:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机代码: G-0CSC\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a tail number, Golf-Zero-Charlie-Sierra-Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.91,0:35:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把目的地给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me a destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前往奥地利柏根市的私人包机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a private charter going to Bregenz, Austria,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.25,0:35:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就要起飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leaving immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.92,0:35:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,授权让007使用喷射机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanner, authorize a charter for 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.00,0:35:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德 拜托你留些活口来问线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Bond, if you could avoid killing every possible lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.22,0:35:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样最好不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would be deeply appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.01,0:35:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命 我会尽力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.76,0:35:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连线中断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connection terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.47,0:35:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过很多次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.77,0:35:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.23,0:35:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎登机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.28,0:35:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:18.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.92,0:36:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.93,0:36:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要飞多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.97,0:36:29.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有共识吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do we have an understanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.14,0:36:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了 我们不会阻止玻利维亚的政变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah. We do nothing to stop a coup in Bolivia,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.06,0:36:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,条件是新政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in exchange, the new government
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.44,0:36:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖到石油要给美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gives America the lease to any oil found.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.65,0:36:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's oil you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.70,0:36:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没挖到钻石吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you didn't find diamonds, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.08,0:36:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在地底钻洞能避免被雷达发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drilling underground, you kept off everybody's radar for a very long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.71,0:36:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但买那么多输油管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you can't buy that much piping
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.59,0:36:59.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有人起疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without somebody getting curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.96,0:37:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须确认找到石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to verify the find.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.05,0:37:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本就没承认有这件事 如果有 免费送给你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not even admitting there is one. You are getting this for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.47,0:37:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,委内瑞拉 巴西 现在又是玻利维亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Venezuela, Brazil, now Bolivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.39,0:37:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国忙着应付中东的局势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With you tied up in the Middle East,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.18,0:37:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南美洲国家像多米诺骨牌一样的垮台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South America is falling like dominoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.48,0:37:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不会让共产党...把国家资源提供给人民吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need another Marxist giving national resources to the people, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.99,0:37:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不知道有政变...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we can hardly be expected to do something
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about a coup we know nothing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.49,0:37:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在烦我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have a pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.08,0:37:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.71,0:37:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道那是谁吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have any idea who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.26,0:37:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.02,0:37:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国情报局的詹姆斯 邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's James Bond, British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.73,0:38:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会没认出他来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how I could have missed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.19,0:38:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你帮我把他除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will need you to get rid of him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.03,0:38:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That's not gonna be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.42,0:38:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(奥地利 柏根市)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.51,0:38:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明知道格林是个大坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who Greene is
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.59,0:38:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却偏偏要和他打交道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you wanna put us in bed with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.72,0:38:29.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在开玩笑吧 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.80,0:38:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我们应该和好人打交道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You're right. We should just deal with nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.22,0:38:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要知道你属于这团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know you're on the team, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.77,0:38:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且很重视你的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know you value your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.07,0:38:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(追踪中)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.80,0:39:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(艺人入口)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.26,0:39:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多明尼克 格林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic Greene.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.61,0:40:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你　你好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.66,0:40:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.82,0:40:51.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位先生女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.90,0:40:57.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歌剧《托斯卡》即将开始 敬请入座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight's performance ofTosca will begin shortly. Please take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.88,0:41:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马卓诺将军还要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else does General Medrano require?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.95,0:42:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加拿大情报局有消息吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything further from Canadian intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.49,0:42:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们待会再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll discuss that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.12,0:42:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还需要多少输油管?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much more pipeline do we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.54,0:42:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好是两千公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ideally, 2,000 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.58,0:42:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人反对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.79,0:42:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.88,0:42:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.30,0:42:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.34,0:42:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钱从西伯利亚帐户转出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transfer the funds from our Siberian holdings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.59,0:42:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.47,0:42:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国的立场是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do the Americans stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.52,0:42:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要他们能分一杯羹 才不会在乎另一个独裁者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the CIA doesn't care about another dictator as long as they get their end.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.98,0:42:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是他们发现被骗呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when they find out that they've been duped?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.65,0:42:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会处理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.65,0:42:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提亚计划会浪费量子集团的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still not sure that the Tierra Project is the best use of Quantum's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:43:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许应该打加拿大的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps we should shift our focus to the Canadian.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.82,0:43:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是世上最珍贵的资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the world's most precious resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.66,0:43:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要尽可能握为己有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to control as much of it as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.00,0:43:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玻利维亚是第一优先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bolivia must be top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.16,0:43:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能岔个话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I offer an opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.54,0:43:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们应该找更好的地方会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really think you people should find a better place to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.01,0:43:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.70,0:43:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.88,0:44:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是每个人都爱看歌剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Tosca isn't for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.29,0:45:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.25,0:45:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你替谁做事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who are you working for?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.59,0:45:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.05,0:45:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把带来的东西丢掉 我们曝光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get rid of anything we brought with us. We've been compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.26,0:45:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你你替谁做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked you who you were working for.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.86,0:45:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是自己人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he one of ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.16,0:45:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.36,0:45:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就不应该看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he shouldn't be looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.63,0:45:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我接M夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me M.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.59,0:46:03.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的电话　谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your line. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.21,0:46:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connect call.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.51,0:46:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接通中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connecting Tanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.01,0:46:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查出照片的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've ID'd the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.55,0:46:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.93,0:46:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格雷戈 卡拉科夫 前任总理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gregor Karakov, former minister,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.01,0:46:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在拥有西伯利亚大部分的矿场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now owns most of the mines in Siberia,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.68,0:46:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫西 萨里夫 前以色列情报局 现在是电信业大亨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moishe Soref, former Mossad, now telecom giant,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.44,0:46:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盖伊 海恩 英国首相的特使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Guy Haines, special envoy to the Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.19,0:46:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打给邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.69,0:46:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.53,0:46:28.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德射杀海恩的保镖 然后把他推下屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears Bond shot Haines' bodyguard and threw him off a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.66,0:46:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里? 拿到我拍的照片吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you? Did you get my pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.50,0:46:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算是问话吗? 你能证明这些人有关系吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was this a conversation? Can you link these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.87,0:46:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的声音好像有点紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that stress in your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.33,0:46:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你回来做简报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to come in and debrief.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.96,0:46:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有时间　邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have time. Bond,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.59,0:46:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在柏根市杀死一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed a man in Bregenz.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.21,0:46:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经尽量约束自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did my best not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.51,0:46:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你射杀他 然后把他推下屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shot him at point blank and threw him off a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.47,0:46:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪一点都不算约束自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd hardly call that showing restraint,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.55,0:46:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是他隶属英国调查局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially since he was a member of Special Branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.52,0:46:55.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在保护谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who was he guarding?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.72,0:46:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀死英国调查局干员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond, are you missing the fact that you killed a member of Special Branch?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.44,0:46:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.48,0:47:03.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想 不过我得找到想杀死你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I would, but right now I need to find the man who tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.73,0:47:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去睡觉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.94,0:47:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通话结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connection terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.32,0:47:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,限制邦德的行动 取消他的信用卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Restrict Bond's movements. Cancel his cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.57,0:47:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注销他护照 所有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put an alert on his passports. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.37,0:47:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查出关于海恩的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want to know everything we don't know about Haines.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.70,0:47:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.83,0:47:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有...小心你该信任谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Tanner, be careful who you trust with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你比我更会看人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully, you're a better judge of character than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.04,0:47:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您要跟您朋友去玻利维亚吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to follow your friends to La Paz, Bolivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.55,0:47:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.09,0:47:29.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.13,0:47:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 这张卡无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir, but this doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.93,0:47:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您有另一张卡吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have another card?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.30,0:47:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.94,0:47:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你帮我一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.98,0:47:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下你会接到电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get a phone call in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.94,0:47:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你告诉对方我要去开罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind telling them I'm headed for Cairo?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.44,0:47:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很乐意　谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be happy to. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.56,0:48:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(意大利 塔拉莫内)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.82,0:48:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mathis.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.95,0:48:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.86,0:48:35.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是来道歉的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.99,0:48:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Mathis,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.29,0:48:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很适合退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think retirement suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.29,0:48:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别给他倒酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.38,0:48:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 他今天心情不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. He's in a bad mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.75,0:48:52.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他害我被严刑拷打 你还要给他喝酒?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.25,0:48:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你买的酒都是便宜货
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.50,0:48:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被证明无辜后 还得到这栋豪宅
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.35,0:49:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以其实是你欠他人情 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.00,0:49:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾玛 去做日光浴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.23,0:49:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要护照和信用卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a passport and matching credit cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.32,0:49:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国情报局缺货吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Ml6 ran out of plastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.91,0:49:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的是 现在我只能信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, oddly, right now, you're the only person I think I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.70,0:49:21.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.45,0:49:24.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜一个人年轻的时候...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I guess when one's young,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.37,0:49:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很容易分别是非对错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it seems very easy to distinguish between right and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.17,0:49:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老了以后就比较难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as one gets older, it becomes more difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.21,0:49:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏人和好人都分不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The villains and the heroes get all mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.22,0:49:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾听到维丝普的死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was sorry to hear about Vesper.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.14,0:49:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为她很爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:40.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.10,0:49:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到她出卖我那一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right up until the moment she betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.39,0:49:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她为了你而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.11,0:49:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底为什么来找我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you really want to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.15,0:49:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要一些资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.78,0:49:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.24,0:50:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友是狠角色 这家伙是主使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have some hard friends. This man is some kind of facilitator.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.58,0:50:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专门干坏事 绝不留下证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fingers in many pies, and they don't leave any prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.00,0:50:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人是一伙的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These men were together?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.79,0:50:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在买输油管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're buying up oil pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.71,0:50:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被称之为提亚计划 你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something called the Tierra Project. Do you know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.38,0:50:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这些销毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy these.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.76,0:50:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是海恩 你不认识他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Guy Haines. You don't know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.76,0:50:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该认识他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.88,0:50:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜不是吧 你不像我保密保了这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose not. You haven't been keeping secrets as long as I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.43,0:50:23.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他非常低调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He keeps a very low profile,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.43,0:50:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他是英国首相的重要顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's one of the Prime Minister's closest advisors.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.19,0:50:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俗话说知己知彼 百战百胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they say you're judged by the strength of your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.86,0:50:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道玻利维亚的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know anything about Bolivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.11,0:50:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在南美洲驻守了七年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was stationed in South America for seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.36,0:50:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那里有线人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, do you have some contacts there?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.70,0:50:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.57,0:50:40.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.66,0:50:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.04,0:50:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你抚摸我...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.86,0:51:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡不着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.24,0:51:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来杯酒吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I fix you a drink, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.15,0:51:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在喝什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.82,0:51:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 我在喝什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. What am I drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.91,0:51:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三份琴酒 一份伏特加 半份的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three measures of Gordon's gin, one of vodka, half of...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.45,0:51:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉兰酒　莉兰酒不是苦艾酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kina Lillet. Kina Lillet, which is not Vermouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.58,0:51:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入冰块均匀搅拌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shaken well until it is ice-cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.38,0:51:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着放上一片柠檬薄片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then served with a large thin slice of lemon peel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.25,0:51:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他喝了六杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.09,0:51:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好酒量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.84,0:51:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好喝 试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're good. You should have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.30,0:51:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了 只会让我睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it'll just keep me awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.23,0:51:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么睡不着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's keeping you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.31,0:51:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想你为什么跟我来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wondering why you came with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.57,0:52:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,承认自己错了需要一点勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes something to admit you were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.83,0:52:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要安眠药吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a sleeping pill?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.08,0:52:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.24,0:52:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,止痛药? 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pain pill? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.95,0:52:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么药都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have pills for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.58,0:52:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些药能让你长高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some make you taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.67,0:52:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些药能让你忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some make you forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.84,0:52:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去试着睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to try and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.34,0:52:23.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.90,0:52:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(玻利维亚 拉巴斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.69,0:52:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.57,0:52:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是费姿 领事馆的工作人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond, my name is Fields. I'm from the consulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.61,0:52:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.70,0:52:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在领事馆做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you do at the consulate, Fields?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.12,0:52:47.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.49,0:52:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我奉命把你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My orders are to turn you around
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.83,0:52:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送上飞机回到伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and put you on the first plane back to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.95,0:52:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括我的朋友马西斯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do those orders include my friend Mathis?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.79,0:52:55.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I don't know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.58,0:52:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才离开没多久就被忘记了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that? Gone such a short time and already forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.84,0:53:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你故意这么说让我难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just saying that to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.63,0:53:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生 这是最高指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond, these orders come from the highest possible authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.84,0:53:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一班到伦敦的班机是几时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi. Fields, when is the next flight to London?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.89,0:53:08.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.39,0:53:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们还有整晚的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then, we have all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.47,0:53:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想逃跑 我会逮捕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you attempt to flee, I will arrest you,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.14,0:53:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你铐上飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drop you off in jail and take you to the plane in chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.69,0:53:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解吗? 了解 你先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand? Perfectly. After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.23,0:53:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得她有手铐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she has handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.77,0:53:20.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.07,0:53:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是下太多雨 就是不下雨!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.33,0:53:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把缺水怪到全球暖化 他们说冰河都融化了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He blames the water shortage on global warming.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.49,0:53:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 卡洛斯? 卡洛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Carlos? Carlos.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.46,0:53:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗? 政府一直在加税... 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.30,0:53:38.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天晓得他们几时会想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.13,0:53:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是掌管全国警察的上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Colonel who heads the National Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.42,0:53:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我阿妈 愿她安息 告诉我...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.30,0:53:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没钱会打给你吗? 她什么都告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.99,0:53:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且她会托梦给我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.72,0:53:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她告诉我...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.26,0:53:55.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她告诉我:买一辆计程车
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.74,0:54:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有订房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.57,0:54:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好吗? - 很好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cmo est? - Very well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.16,0:54:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 姓名? - 费姿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your name? - Miss Fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.29,0:54:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪儿也别想去　杀死我呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going nowhere. So shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.25,0:54:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿住太平间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather stay in a morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.34,0:54:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的身份是休假的老师 住这里符合我们的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are teachers on sabbatical. This fits our cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.67,0:54:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才怪 上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it doesn't. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.51,0:54:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.54,0:54:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是休假的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.81,0:54:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们中了彩票
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.75,0:54:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜了 我能效劳吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.87,0:54:55.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.13,0:55:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我带您参观房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I show you your room, senor?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.50,0:55:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's fine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找不到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find the, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.61,0:55:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,文具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stationery.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.11,0:55:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来帮我找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you come and help me look?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.59,0:55:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们受邀参加一场派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been invited to a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.84,0:55:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道这里有朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know we had any friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.51,0:55:52.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿色星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greene Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.26,0:55:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.35,0:55:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和上校喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having a drink with my friend the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.60,0:55:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you there later.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.90,0:56:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我有多生自己的气吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how angry I am at myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.11,0:56:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无法想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.61,0:56:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定气炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.04,0:56:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想参加一场派对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to go to a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.96,0:56:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A party?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.00,0:56:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我没有礼服穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have nothing to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.55,0:56:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.22,0:56:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(绿色星球 慈善基金会)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.23,0:56:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你的真名比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might be useful to know your real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.65,0:56:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费姿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.70,0:56:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是费姿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just Fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.20,0:56:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是费姿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fields it is, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.91,0:57:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的生态环境愈变愈糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are in a spiral of environmental decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.83,0:57:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从1945年...地球有17%的植栽表面...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since 1945, 17% of the planet's vegetated surface
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.00,0:57:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经无法恢复原貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been irreversibly degraded.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.68,0:57:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提亚计划只是绿色星球打造的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Tierra Project is just one small part of a global network of Eco Parks
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.14,0:57:21.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全球生态公园的一小部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Greene Planet has created
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.27,0:57:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的是拯救濒临瓦解的地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to rejuvenate a world on the verge of collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.44,0:57:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望今晚各位也能成为一分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope that tonight you make the decision to be part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.70,0:57:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.28,0:57:40.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家玩得开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.37,0:57:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 恭喜 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Congratulations. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.29,0:57:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得真好 恭喜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent speech and congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.42,0:57:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得很好 多明尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful speech, Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.63,0:57:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要你　谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you here. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.63,0:57:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费姿 邦德 我朋友卡洛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Fields, Mr. Bond, my friend Carlos.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.01,0:57:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸会　女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pleased to meet you. Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.97,0:57:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马西斯把你的事都告诉我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond, Mathis has spoken a great deal about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.01,0:58:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我管辖的警力可以任你差遣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to know my entire police force is at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.27,0:58:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that could be very useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.77,0:58:09.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国民要花一半薪资...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, there are people in this country spending half their paycheck
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.11,0:58:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来买干净的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just to get clean water.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.69,0:58:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么看法?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.82,0:58:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题出在玻利维亚政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bolivian government is the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.99,0:58:15.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们滥伐树木\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cut down the trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.74,0:58:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当水和土壤被冲刷到海里还装蒜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then act surprised when the water and the soil wash out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.95,0:58:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全同意 希望这点钱能帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't agree more. I hope this figure is to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.54,0:58:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别开玩笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chri, you shouldn't tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.00,0:58:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他们你在波多西买的土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell them about all the land you bought up outside Potos?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.13,0:58:32.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸会了 失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a pleasure. Will you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.42,0:58:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.84,0:58:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伐木权...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow the logging rights
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.09,0:58:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都被滥伐树木的集团买走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}went to a multinational corporation that cut down the forests,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.26,0:58:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是政府把土地卖给绿色星球以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but only after our last government sold the land to Greene Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.93,0:58:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有没有说错呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or have I got my facts crossed?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.35,0:58:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I think you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.10,0:58:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.77,0:58:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真美好的夜晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a wonderful night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.03,0:59:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你害我损失一大笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just cost me quite a bit of money, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.70,0:59:02.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原则是买不到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't put a price on integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.49,0:59:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.62,0:59:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.58,0:59:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.96,0:59:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不只是跑来扫我的兴吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me you didn't drop by tonight just to piss on my parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.01,0:59:19.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你是想要将军的人头吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or are you still after this General's head for your mantel?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.01,0:59:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两者皆是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little of both.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.64,0:59:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我将军在哪里 也许你就不会再失去投资者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me where Medrano is and maybe you won't lose any more investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.48,0:59:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真让我很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are really breaking my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.65,0:59:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了他陷害我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}choosing an insect like that over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.82,0:59:36.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想把我推下去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to throw me over?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.61,0:59:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喝了酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You've been drinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.32,0:59:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是不小心滑倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so maybe you slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.45,0:59:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会很想我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Just think how much you'd miss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.66,0:59:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.25,0:59:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.67,0:59:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请恕我失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.71,0:59:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.09,1:00:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎大驾光临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.89,1:00:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小妞很难搞 在达到目的之前...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, careful with this one. She won't go to bed with you
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.18,1:00:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不会和你上床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless you give her something she really wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.93,1:00:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过她的床上功夫...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame because she's really quite stunning
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.18,1:00:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不是盖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once you get her on her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.06,1:00:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜你的床上功夫不怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could say the feeling was mutual.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.82,1:00:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mr. Greene, but we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.19,1:00:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友都叫我多明尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. My friends call me Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.57,1:00:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.28,1:00:24.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对邦德了解多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do you know about Bond, Camille?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.82,1:00:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说他是个大灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he's rather a tragic case.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.20,1:00:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连英国情报局也管不了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Ml6 says, he's difficult to control.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要和他牵扯的人都非死即伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice way of saying that everything he touches seems to wither and die.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.92,1:00:36.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.21,1:00:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可要小心一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't bode well for you, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.84,1:00:40.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你们倒是天生一对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two do make a charming couple, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.01,1:00:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们都是...该怎么说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're both... What's the expression?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.01,1:00:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑕疵品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damaged goods.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.06,1:00:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.52,1:00:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.77,1:00:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放轻松点 别坏我的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, lighten up. You're cramping my style.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.03,1:01:02.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是英国情报员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's British intelligence now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.07,1:01:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.70,1:01:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看多明尼克的提亚计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna show me Dominic Greene's Tierra Project.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.53,1:01:09.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你行吗? 我有选择吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you up to it? Do I have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.66,1:01:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want one?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.54,1:01:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个人超霸道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something horribly efficient about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.50,1:01:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算是称赞吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a compliment?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.64,1:01:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林在警方有朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what's the bet that Dominic Greene has friends in the police force?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.20,1:01:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留在车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.16,1:01:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.62,1:01:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请出示证件
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.53,1:02:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请打开后车厢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.64,1:02:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要我这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, why would you want me to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.49,1:02:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他抬出来!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.12,1:02:15.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.37,1:02:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他抬出来!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.55,1:02:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在动
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.73,1:02:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快开枪!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.67,1:02:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马西斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mathis?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.96,1:02:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市区另一边有医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a hospital on the other side of town.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.09,1:02:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.51,1:02:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在我身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.85,1:02:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.48,1:02:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.14,1:02:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.90,1:03:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.28,1:03:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.11,1:03:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不痛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.99,1:03:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马西斯是你的假名吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Mathis your cover name?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.16,1:03:16.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.50,1:03:20.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是很好 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a very good one, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.26,1:03:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们原谅对方了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we forgive each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.84,1:03:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不该丢下你一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't have left you alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.89,1:03:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维丝普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vesper.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.43,1:03:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她为你付出一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She gave everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.98,1:03:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原谅她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.53,1:03:47.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也原谅你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.63,1:04:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是这样对待朋友的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that how you treat your friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.59,1:04:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会在乎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.48,1:04:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.12,1:04:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外交部长要见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Foreign Secretary's asking to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.66,1:04:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What don't I know?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.12,1:04:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马西斯在玻利维亚遭到射杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rene Mathis has been shot dead in Bolivia.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.67,1:04:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方说凶手是邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The police claim it was Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.95,1:05:15.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能效劳吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.29,1:05:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你付他多少钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much did you pay him?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.58,1:05:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他本来要你 我用车抵押\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he wanted you, but I left him the car as collateral.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.00,1:05:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他出卖我们会赚更多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll make much more when he sells us out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.67,1:05:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.22,1:05:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这玩意能不能飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if this thing'll fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.82,1:05:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.03,1:05:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的资料说这里什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the information I found said there was nothing of value there,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.66,1:05:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林的地质学家却说有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Greene's geologist had proof that there was.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.20,1:06:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你是玻利维亚情报局干员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sources tell me you're Bolivian Secret Service,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.67,1:06:08.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者曾经是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or used to be,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.25,1:06:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为了潜入格林的组织跟他上床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that you infiltrated Greene's organization by having sex with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.59,1:06:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你觉得不对吗? - 一点都不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That offends you? - No, not in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.88,1:06:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么对格林有兴趣?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's your interest in Greene?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.30,1:06:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要杀死我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amongst other things, he tried to kill a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.43,1:06:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一个女人?  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A woman? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.39,1:06:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过不是你想的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.02,1:06:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是你妈妈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.27,1:06:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她喜欢这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She likes to think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.69,1:06:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.24,1:06:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落水洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a sinkhole.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.99,1:06:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这附近有好几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a few around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.24,1:06:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想说 我和格林不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just for the record, I wasn't with Greene for my...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.55,1:07:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标锁定 将目标击落
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.74,1:07:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.44,1:07:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们甩掉他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we lost him!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.15,1:07:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秃鹰 这是马尔凯蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.15,1:07:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标在300度 10公里外
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.36,1:08:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他来得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.33,1:08:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就在你后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.21,1:09:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来! 穿上去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Put that on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.75,1:10:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.65,1:10:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡蜜儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camille!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.17,1:11:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玻利维亚警方说邦德被拦下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to the Bolivians, it was a routine stop,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.68,1:11:10.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后开枪射死两名警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when they discovered Mathis' body, Bond disarmed and shot them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.76,1:11:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没有目击证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, there are no witnesses to prove otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.97,1:11:15.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要证据 不能就这样去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need something. I can't go in there unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.85,1:11:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 没有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.35,1:11:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.15,1:11:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有什么藉口? 邦德成了法盲了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's today's excuse? That Bond is legally blind?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.69,1:11:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.90,1:11:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不说你也知道首相很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I need to tell you how upset the PM is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.07,1:11:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我直言 首相有我的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With respect, the PM has my direct line.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.74,1:11:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想跟你讲话就会打给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he'd have used it if he'd wanted to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.37,1:11:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 局势改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, M. Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.50,1:11:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们和盟友有很长的讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had long discussions with our cousins.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.21,1:11:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林先生的兴趣和我们不谋而和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Greene's interests and ours now align.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.55,1:11:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是世上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minister, this man is a major player
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.63,1:11:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最危险的组织的主使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in one of the most dangerous organizations...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.05,1:11:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们根本没听过这组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've never even heard of.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.05,1:11:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外交政策不能根据直觉而定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foreign policy cannot be conducted on the basis of hunches and innuendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.47,1:11:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我们时间收集证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then give us time to gather enough evidence
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.73,1:11:59.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让你做出正确的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can make informed decisions.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.81,1:12:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.31,1:12:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假设你说的对 格林是个坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say you're right. Say Greene is a villain.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.40,1:12:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们不跟坏蛋打交道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we refused to do business with villains,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.15,1:12:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就没有贸易伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd have almost no one to trade with.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.03,1:12:11.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界的石油短缺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's running out of oil, M.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.91,1:12:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄国不肯跟我们做生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Russians aren't playing ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.24,1:12:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中美瓜分剩下的存量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Americans and Chinese are dividing up what's left.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.62,1:12:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非对错并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right or wrong doesn't come into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.20,1:12:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们非得这么做不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're acting out of necessity.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.50,1:12:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德失去控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond is running wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.13,1:12:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁晓得他没有叛变?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's to say he hasn't been turned?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.88,1:12:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他叫回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull him in
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.09,1:12:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然美国佬就会杀死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the Americans will put him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.93,1:12:39.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到出口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I found a way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.23,1:12:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你冷到发抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.77,1:12:44.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.62,1:13:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林有什么你要的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what is it that Greene has that you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.67,1:13:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟格林无关 是马卓诺将军 他在海地碰面的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not Greene. It's Medrano, the man he met in Haiti.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.43,1:13:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲曾经在他麾下服役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father worked for the military junta.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.85,1:13:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个冷血无情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a very cruel man,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.64,1:13:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他是我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he was my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.27,1:13:28.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a small child
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.40,1:13:32.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反叛军派马卓诺到我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the opposition sent general Medrano to our house.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.86,1:13:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀死我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He shot my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.62,1:13:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强暴我妈妈和姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did things to my mother and my sister
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.41,1:13:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后在我面前把她们勒死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then strangled them while I watched.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.29,1:13:48.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还太小 逃过一劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was too young to be any trouble,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.25,1:13:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只对我笑一笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he just smiled at me
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.80,1:13:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就放火烧了我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and set the house on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.68,1:14:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在我身上留下疤痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left his mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.27,1:14:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我把你从船上拉下来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when I pulled you off the boat...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.98,1:14:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等那一刻等了好多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I waited years for that chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.61,1:14:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.70,1:14:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都在利用格林对付别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems we're both using Greene to get to somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.07,1:14:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失去心爱的人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost somebody?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.41,1:14:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.79,1:14:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你逮到凶手没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You catch whoever did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.33,1:14:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.50,1:14:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.84,1:14:31.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逮到告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me when you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.46,1:14:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道那种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to know how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.01,1:14:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.18,1:14:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.47,1:15:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们用了炸药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They used dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.43,1:15:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里以前是河床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This used to be a riverbed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.41,1:15:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林要的不是石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greene isn't after the oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.28,1:15:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是水源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.20,1:15:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能放着不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't leave it like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.87,1:15:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是一座水坝 他要造成旱灾 他还会盖更多水坝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one dam. He's creating a drought. He'll have built others.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.01,1:17:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尊夫人留言给您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir. Your wife left a message.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.55,1:17:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那位英国女士把这个留给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The English woman, she left it for you this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.51,1:17:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你　- 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.48,1:17:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.10,1:17:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你介意在这里等吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind waiting down here?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.23,1:17:39.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到外面等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.88,1:17:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来她是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's what she meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.34,1:18:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你们信任这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you can trust these men.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.84,1:18:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请稍等 是坦纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a moment. It's Tanner.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.84,1:18:05.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.51,1:18:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在楼下拦住那女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got the girl downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.93,1:18:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说抱歉 这不是她的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says to tell you she's sorry but this is not her fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.26,1:18:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 放她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't. Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.93,1:18:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她跟我们无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She isn't our concern.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.52,1:18:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.77,1:18:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.90,1:18:21.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国佬答应给你们多少石油?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much oil did the Americans promise you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.11,1:18:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟石油无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't about oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.28,1:18:23.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 因为没有石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's good, because there isn't any.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.61,1:18:25.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟信任有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.53,1:18:27.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你的动机不是复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you weren't motivated by revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.45,1:18:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的动机是任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm motivated by my duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.16,1:18:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.95,1:18:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法平复的愤怒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you are so blinded by inconsolable rage
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.04,1:18:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已让你变的冷血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you don't care who you hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.46,1:18:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若你无法分辨敌我 就该停职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you can't tell your friends from your enemies, it's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.63,1:18:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以告诉她没有石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might like to tell her your theory about there being no oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.80,1:18:51.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的肺部全都是石油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her lungs are full of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.64,1:18:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是格林干的 - 没错 但是为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was Greene. - No doubt. But why?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.65,1:19:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是杀错人了 为什么要杀她?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just misdirection. I mean, why her, Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.90,1:19:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她只负责送你回英国 她在办公室工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was just supposed to send you home. She worked in an office,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.78,1:19:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整理报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}collecting reports.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.45,1:19:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你是多有魅力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look how well your charm works, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.49,1:19:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们为了你什么都肯做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll do anything for you, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.54,1:19:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多少女人因你而死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many is that now?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.08,1:19:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被停职 等待接受调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're removed from duty and suspended pending further investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.04,1:19:23.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把武器交出来 跟他们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll give whatever weapons you have to these men and leave with them now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.63,1:20:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费姿展现无比的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Fields showed true bravery.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.72,1:20:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告一定要提到这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want that mentioned in your report.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.72,1:20:15.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我必须完成调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you and I need to see this through.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.64,1:20:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪儿都去不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.72,1:20:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人下令看到你格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a capture or kill order out on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.44,1:20:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁会这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who would have done that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.40,1:20:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人? 查出他去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am? Find out where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.37,1:20:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有线索　但是中情局...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on to something. Ma'am, the CIA is insisting...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.45,1:20:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不甩中情局和他们的假证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could give a shit about the CIA or their trumped-up evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.08,1:20:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的情报员 我信任他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my agent, and I trust him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.54,1:20:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.51,1:20:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.93,1:20:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要开枪杀我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna try and shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.30,1:20:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.53,1:21:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喝那玩意会杆菌中毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get botulism if you keep drinking that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.16,1:21:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是瓶装矿泉水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bottled water.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.08,1:21:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是来自附近溪流的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It probably came from some stream just around the corner from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.91,1:21:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友在里面尿尿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunch of little kids peeing in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.62,1:21:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才吃辣椒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I eat the peppers.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.17,1:21:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, all I'm saying is
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.59,1:21:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里什么都不能信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't trust a damn thing around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.64,1:21:40.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该直接说"中情局"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you should just answer, "CIA," Felix.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.10,1:21:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连计程车司机都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A taxi driver told me where the office was.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.48,1:21:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这么好找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if we're so easy to find, James,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.31,1:21:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该来一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you really should come visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.69,1:21:49.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你应该多出门走走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe you should come out and see some more of the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.38,1:22:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你变得像南美洲人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard a rumor you'd gone native.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.38,1:22:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费利克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felix.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.80,1:22:22.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有可卡因或共产党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I was just wondering what South America would look like
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.14,1:22:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道南美洲会变成怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if nobody gave a damn about coke or communism.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.35,1:22:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很佩服你们把这地方搞成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always impressed me the way you boys have carved this place up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.02,1:22:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国人这么说算是称赞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that as a compliment coming from a Brit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.73,1:22:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定你站在对的一边吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you're playing with the right side?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.90,1:22:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政权每星期换一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regimes change once a week down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.91,1:22:38.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马卓诺不会比别人更腐败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medrano'll be no dirtier than the next guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.87,1:22:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才喜欢美国情报局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you see, that's what I like about U.S. Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.99,1:22:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们肯和任何人合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll lie down with anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.49,1:22:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括你 兄弟 包括你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including you, brother. Including you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.00,1:22:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们被耍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know you're being played?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.50,1:22:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林会把这地方榨干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dominic Greene's gonna suck this place dry, and then he's gonna move on,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.92,1:22:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们留下来 收拾烂摊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're gonna be left picking up the broken crockery.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.21,1:22:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天下没有白吃的午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I tell you? There's no such thing as a free lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.17,1:22:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你没有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you see, Felix, I don't think you're half as cynical
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.18,1:22:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么无情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you make out to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.39,1:22:59.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又不了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.72,1:23:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么? 因为你带了人来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Just because you didn't come alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.18,1:23:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有多少时间?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have I got?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.27,1:23:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,30秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.56,1:23:13.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间还真不充裕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that doesn't give us a lot of time, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.90,1:23:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马卓诺得先贿赂军方和警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medrano can't move until he pays off the army and the police chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.49,1:23:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林正在带钱去给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greene's bringing him his money now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.20,1:23:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙丘旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hotel called La Perla de las Dunas
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.66,1:23:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在沙漠中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.33,1:23:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.45,1:23:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, move your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.71,1:23:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下! 趴下! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down! Get down, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.77,1:23:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走! 快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.52,1:23:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事? 你跟他说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened? What did you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.28,1:23:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们同意的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.22,1:24:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旅馆的保安有问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.42,1:24:31.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.35,1:24:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是电池 整间旅馆都靠它发电
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.26,1:24:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实很讨厌
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.28,1:24:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来很不安全...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.53,1:24:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您需要什么 我能效劳吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.45,1:24:52.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问得好 来杯饮料吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.18,1:24:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您要喝什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.61,1:24:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啤酒
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.07,1:24:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一杯啤酒 您呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.05,1:24:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.20,1:25:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.83,1:25:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪膛卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The slide's caught.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.70,1:25:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也应该检查你的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should check your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.04,1:25:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.42,1:25:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀过人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever killed someone?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.93,1:25:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你接受的训练...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your training will tell you that when the adrenaline kicks in
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.30,1:25:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会让你冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should compensate.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.22,1:25:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这次没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But part of you is not gonna believe the training
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.93,1:25:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你要报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because this kill is personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.56,1:25:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.73,1:25:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要开一枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You only need one shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.57,1:26:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一枪毙命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it count.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.92,1:26:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.13,1:27:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.13,1:27:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In euros,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.39,1:27:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全照你的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as requested.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.89,1:27:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美元贬值得太厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dollar isn't what it once was.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.60,1:27:15.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是战争害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cost of war.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.02,1:27:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能再容忍...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am afraid that the corruption in this current government
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.73,1:27:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政府的腐败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can no longer be tolerated.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.82,1:27:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的钱呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.82,1:27:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得先签署土地让渡书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right after you sign over my land.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.99,1:27:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到我的套房
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.09,1:27:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的第一个官方政策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My first official act.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.51,1:27:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.85,1:27:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.31,1:27:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这一刻开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of this moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.52,1:28:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的组织拥有贵国六成的水源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my organization owns more than 60% of Bolivia's water supply.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.61,1:28:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这份合约规定你的新政府...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this contract states that your new government
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.36,1:28:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须让我们成为水电供应商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will use us as utilities provider.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.07,1:28:13.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这比我们付的钱多两倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is double what we are paying now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.58,1:28:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就别签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then don't sign it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.54,1:28:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你要了解我和我的伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you should know something about me and the people I work with.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.25,1:28:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们和左派或右派合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We deal with the left or the right,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.38,1:28:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也和独裁者或自由派合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with dictators or liberators.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.68,1:28:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是目前的总统答应我的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the current president had been more agreeable,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.35,1:28:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就不会跟你合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.64,1:28:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你决定不签的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if you decide not to sign,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.98,1:28:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会死得很惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will wake up with your balls in your mouth
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.23,1:28:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的替代者会站在你旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your willing replacement standing over you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.40,1:28:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不信的话就开枪杀死我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you doubt that, then shoot me,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.78,1:28:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钱拿走 然后好好睡一觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take that money and have a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.42,1:29:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我有相同的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I had a mutual friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.68,1:31:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的表情跟你妈当时一模一样
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.13,1:32:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次 你也跑不掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.93,1:32:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听似你身边又少了一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like you just lost another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.34,1:34:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this way. Not this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.17,1:34:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.31,1:34:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.73,1:34:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么说的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you said,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.61,1:34:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"深呼吸"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.74,1:34:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"一枪毙命"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Make it count."
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.54,1:34:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.76,1:34:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.61,1:35:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.10,1:35:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你答应要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised that you'd...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.18,1:35:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放你走?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.43,1:35:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回答了你的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I answered your questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.81,1:35:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也告诉你关于量子的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you what you wanted to know about Quantum.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.65,1:35:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you did,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.61,1:35:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的伙伴也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your friends'd know that
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.73,1:35:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会追杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they're probably looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.69,1:35:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好消息是 你人在沙漠中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the good news is, you're in the middle of a desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.12,1:35:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.29,1:36:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打赌你要走30公里才会想要喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you make it 20 miles before you consider drinking that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.04,1:36:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 格林先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Mr. Greene.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.67,1:36:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.88,1:36:46.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.92,1:36:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.01,1:36:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.68,1:36:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我一直在想: 他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I keep thinking, "He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.39,1:36:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Now what?"
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.22,1:36:58.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看到的水坝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the dam we saw will have to come down,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.77,1:36:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须被毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there'll be others, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.89,1:37:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好格林的手下能帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone who worked for Greene might be of help.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.69,1:37:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这主意不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.07,1:37:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想他们现在睡得着吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think they'll be able to sleep now?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.41,1:37:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死人应该不担心别人报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think the dead care about vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.79,1:37:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很想放你自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could set you free.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.42,1:37:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你被禁在心牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your prison is in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.80,1:38:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(俄罗斯 卡赞)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.93,1:38:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 能活下去要我怎样都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. Anything for an easy life.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.81,1:38:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.98,1:38:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我坐下来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.65,1:38:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.09,1:38:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是加拿大人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Canadian?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.25,1:38:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你替加拿大情报局做事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work in Canadian intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.72,1:38:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.47,1:38:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你认识这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And knowing this man,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.39,1:39:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你必须交出机密文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd guess you have access to some very sensitive material
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.01,1:39:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然他就有生命危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which you're gonna be forced to give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.18,1:39:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很爱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His life will be threatened,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.43,1:39:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你不会犹豫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and because you love him, you won't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.36,1:39:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很美的项链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a beautiful necklace.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.07,1:39:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他送你的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he give it to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.90,1:39:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have one just like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.99,1:39:22.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他送给我一个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave it to a friend of mine,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.49,1:39:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我很亲密的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}someone very close to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.21,1:39:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name is?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.63,1:39:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珂伦　珂伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corrine. Corrine.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.00,1:39:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你马上离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corrine, I suggest you leave now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.55,1:39:37.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你的上司调查双面间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You contact your people, and you tell them to check their seals.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.09,1:39:38.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们局里有内鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have a leak.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.01,1:39:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你马上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it now, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.72,1:39:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和他还有未了的恩怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man and I have some unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.40,1:39:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.45,1:40:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.41,1:40:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我个痛快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.38,1:40:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还活着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.88,1:40:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.59,1:40:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很吃惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.38,1:40:21.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到你要找的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.26,1:40:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.10,1:40:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜你不会后悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume you have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.52,1:40:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.14,1:40:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.27,1:40:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不会 这样太不专业了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not. That would be unprofessional.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.11,1:40:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们发现格林死在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found Greene dead
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.27,1:40:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玻利维亚沙漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of the Bolivian desert, of all places.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.11,1:40:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后脑勺两个弹孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two bullets in the back of his skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.61,1:40:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胃部还有汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found motor oil in his stomach.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.41,1:40:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这件事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.45,1:40:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望我能帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wish I could help.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.16,1:40:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和美国佬把事情搞定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be glad to know, I straightened things out with the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.29,1:40:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的朋友升职了 他取代了毕恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend Leiter's been promoted. He replaced Beam.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.75,1:40:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的对的人保住他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then the right people kept their jobs.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.25,1:40:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.59,1:41:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜 你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations. You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.18,1:41:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.18,1:41:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于维丝普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About Vesper.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.14,1:41:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.81,1:41:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.44,1:41:16.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.52,1:41:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没有离开过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never left.
